OL,3,ACan Trump really pay $5,000 to every
OL,4,AAmerican adult?
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS Vice-President JD Vance suggested it
OL,7,Fmight be paid for by tariff revenue and
OL,8,Fthat such cheques would not go to
OL,9,Fwealthy Americans.
